WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:05.730
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.010
Troublesome.

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:10.170
I can't stand it.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.440
Hypocrite.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.910
You don't understand.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.210
Hurry.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:15.550
Shut up.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:19.710
It's too late.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.260
I don't want to die.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:39.290
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:46.940
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.950
Although loneliness...

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:55.280
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:00:55.790 --> 00:01:02.520
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:07.600
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:10.570
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:18.100
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:21.880
...the dream and the reality...

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:25.510
...that you saw cross paths

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:29.210
Some light is shed...

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.790
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:41.030
...so that we can go to a different place

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:49.030
The things I want have no shape

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:57.300
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:11.390
Beyond the Vast Sea

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:18.000
<i>The centrifugal gravity</i>
<i>in Liebel is only temporary.</i>

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.840
<i>So at this time, please</i>
<i>pack your belongings.</i>

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:23.910
<i>Should you need immediate assistance...</i>

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:27.640
<i>...please contact the Navigation</i>
<i>Second Term Zwei team.</i>

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.980
I forgot my underwear!

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:32.510
I'll lend you mine.

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:34.950
No, your bra's too small for me.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:36.120
Here.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:36.950
Thank you.

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:39.290
Does anybody not have one yet?

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.620
Kelly...

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:45.790
Don't cry. Here, you
can have my Katherine.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.620
Everything's gonna be all right!

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:56.370
We have Zwei and their navigational skills,
and the instructors! We will be saved...!

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.030
Shut up! Can't I get some peace?

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:01.170
Ume! The guys in Operations need help.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.100
But I work for the Equipment Team.

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:05.610
What does that matter?

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:08.240
If this ship doesn't move,
we'll never escape from here!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.090
Did everybody survive?

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:21.720
I don't know. I heard there
are 487 students on Liebel.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:23.090
Aoi!!

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:24.630
Yes?

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:26.100
She asked if we've seen Aiba?

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.900
Which one?

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:29.710
Kouji.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:31.370
Kouji? Huh?

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:33.980
What's wrong?

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.440
Have you seen Kouji?

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:38.280
He's gone?

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.910
He's quicker than I imagined.
I'll go take a look!

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:43.750
I'll go too!

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:47.290
No! You've gotta do your own stuff first.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:48.260
Later.

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.190
Press it down with your finger, you fool.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:53.390
I know that, but...!

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:55.230
Really?

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:56.200
Shh!

00:03:57.230 --> 00:04:00.360
I hear the instructors forced the purge.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.840
So the only ones left to move the ship...

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.440
...are the Zwei members.

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:06.430
Oh, boy.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:09.040
Should we let Blue know?

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:16.240
Ouch. I see
you're awake.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:18.150
Where am I?

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:21.190
Inside Liebel.

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:24.290
Everything's all right now.

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:28.890
Well, not everything. They're
still preparing for the escape.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.260
You saved my life?

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:33.770
Yeah.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:36.960
I wonder if Rafra's okay.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.380
Thank you.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:45.740
Ah, no problem. By the way,
what were you doing there?

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.650
Excuse me.

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.450
I-I'm sorry!

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.020
I knew I'd find you here!

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:02.930
Let me introduce you! This is my partner,
Ikumi Oze! We carried you here together.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:06.600
I'm Faina S. Shinozaki. Thank you.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.400
You'd better be grateful.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.370
By the way, someone was looking for you.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:14.680
Who?

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:18.580
Zwei, I guess. Maybe they
need you for inspection.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.050
Okay.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:23.720
Um, is there anyone that I
should tell that you're here?

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.420
No, I'll be okay.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:28.650
O-Okay. Get well.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:31.560
How is she?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.660
You saw her.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.660
That's not what I mean.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:37.530
- Then what <i>do</i> you mean?
- Never mind.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:43.370
We Zwei are busy with the flight approach.
There is no time to hear every request...

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:44.410
I've gotta pee.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:47.710
You don't want us to
pee our pants, do you?

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.880
Now, hurry up and open it.

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:52.580
Well, but...

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.430
<i>Teacher...</i>

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:15.070
Thank you.

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:17.570
We're gonna be okay, right?

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:21.030
Unless we believe that, we'll
lose what little chance we have.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.180
You're very strong.

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:25.080
I've been taught that way.

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:32.620
Juli, come here for a moment.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.590
Oh, sorry.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.130
That's it.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:48.830
I hope Rafra found her way there.

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:55.810
We've only been here for three months.
There's no way we can figure this out.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.310
Do your best. Our lives depend on it!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.370
No problems?

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.050
Oh, let me confirm.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:04.080
Hey, you think we'll survive?

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:07.790
I don't know. I'm just doing
all that I can to help.

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:11.280
I'll bet everyone's thinking
they should've studied harder.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:13.590
They already are.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.260
Back then...

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:22.260
...in the dressing room. You
said "again". What did you mean?

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:33.080
Are you telling me not to ask?

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:36.990
Would you like it if I brought
up the subject of your brother?

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:38.450
Sorry!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.650
What an awful sight.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.650
Who'd have known we'd have no teachers?

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:09.750
You talk too much.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.720
But Zwei's commanding this ship.

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:17.460
Sorry, but weak people
have to be more obedient.

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:22.760
As long as the Zwei members
have things under control...

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:24.820
...we'll sit back and watch, right?

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.380
This is Juli Bahana of Zwei.

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:39.050
We have less than two hours
before Liebel's flight.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:43.390
<i>Some section partitions were closed to</i>
<i>increase the life support mode to five.</i>

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:46.320
<i>There are no problems with the approach</i>
<i>operations taken by the bridge.</i>

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:50.060
<i>I ask for your continued cooperation for a
<i>little longer, so that we can all survive.</i></i>

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:51.730
<i>We thank you for your understanding.</i>

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.690
Okay! We're gonna be saved! Alright!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:58.470
We've gotten rid of all staff.
There's only this ship left.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:01.340
If the kids make a mistake and
change the course of the ship...

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.270
...we won't be able to make contact.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:04.840
Rafra.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:06.940
Shall we use her?

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.910
Rafra.

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:14.820
Where have you been?

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:15.780
Inspecting.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.320
And before that?

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.450
To see a girl.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:19.420
Hey!

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:24.690
Why didn't you do your part of the job?

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:26.430
It's voluntary, right?

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:28.300
Don't you understand our situation?

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.830
What are you so afraid of?

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:32.070
He's at it again.

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:34.770
- Wait.
- Shut up!

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:36.400
Why, that's the little brother.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:38.370
What do you think you're doing?

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.080
Stop it!

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:43.580
Why won't you behave yourself?
Are you implying something?

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:46.250
What is it you want?

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:49.420
Hey, say something! Why should
I pay for your blunders?

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:50.620
I never asked you to!

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.120
Can't you at least acknowledge
the danger we're in?

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.750
We could all die, you know!

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:56.450
Die...

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:00.660
You're pathetic!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.630
No... I didn't mean to...!

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.770
Um... I'm sorry.

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:19.310
This could be our last chance, so
I'm just gonna say what I feel.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.080
I'm in love with you!

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:24.990
What a fool.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:25.920
Thank you.

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:28.220
You're kidding!

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:31.030
But...

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:31.920
...I'm sorry.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.630
Congratulations!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:41.570
Hey.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:42.470
What?

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:43.940
Tell me.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.540
What did he do?

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.880
Oh, he expressed his feelings,
then self-disintegrated.

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:50.850
Huh?

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.840
Never mind.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.780
Idiot.

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.190
What's wrong with her?

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.900
Flight approach, complete.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.200
We'll be okay on auto from now on.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.340
Good!

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:18.210
I've experienced more today than
I can fit in an autobiography.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:20.140
My father will be proud of me.

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:21.740
Your father?

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.770
Yeah. He was a helmsman
until ten years ago.

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:26.650
That's why you're here?

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:28.580
My dream is to be like my father.

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:31.450
What happened to you?

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:34.060
I missed the transfer point, so...!

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.590
You're not a kid anymore!

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.560
Hey, I see a peculiar shadow.

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:42.390
It... disappeared.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:46.000
Get a hold of yourself.
We're members of Zwei.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.600
Besides, we have little time before our flight!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.930
R-Right.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:54.870
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:58.410 --> 00:11:59.880
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:06.220
<i>How come?</i>

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:09.450
Why should you have to look after
your brother's duties as well?

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.760
I can't exactly ignore it.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:12.960
You take things too seriously.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:15.800
What's that supposed to mean?

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:17.800
I've got no other choice.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:20.100
I'm not doing it 'cause I want to.

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.970
Can you elaborate?

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.440
Why am I doing this?

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:26.410
What is it?

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:28.940
That girl.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:32.010
That girl? Is there still someone left here?

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:36.250
Please no. Hallucinations?
Give me a break.

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:39.690
Hey! Over here!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.360
We have a major problem!
We've gotta inform the bridge!

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:44.330
What is it?

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:50.000
<i>We have completed our flight approach.</i>

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:54.640
<i>Navigation Training Ship Liebel</i>
<i>will commence flight in 58 minutes.</i>

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.600
We will be saved. We will all be saved.

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:01.340
Wonderful news, isn't it, Aoi?

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:05.510
Why can't they be here at times like this?
Those guys have the worst sense of timing.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:10.480
<i>We wish to express our gratitude</i>
<i>to all those who helped... Wh-What?</i>

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.530
Damn. What in the world's going on here?

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:24.020
Think later!

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.760
W-We have a problem!

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:40.950
What a thrill it was.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:42.880
You think we'll be interviewed?

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:45.150
No! Not like this!

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:48.920
Come to think of it, the
instructors haven't returned yet.

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:50.650
They're probably at the bridge.

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:52.330
What part of Mars?

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.390
Deimos.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.730
I'm from Phobos.

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.230
That's really close.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.330
I told you we'd be okay, didn't I?

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:02.070
I'm never wrong about these things!

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.600
I thought I told you to shut up!

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.740
That puts a damper on things.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:09.810
If this was gonna be the end,
I was quite prepared for it.

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:11.510
I'm not.

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:13.310
Hey, what made you go out with me?

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:18.390
I thought you might be my type.

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:19.420
Were you wrong?

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.390
Yeah.

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:23.160
You're so direct.

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:31.460
It's no use. Not with two of them.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:35.160
We have just one request.
Stop the countdown.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.240
Why?

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:40.270
Enter the password,
and stop the countdown.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.280
If you have an objective, please tell us.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:44.650
At this rate, this ship will be
crushed along with Liebe Delta.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:46.310
We're almost at Sere 3.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.120
You'll end up perishing with us.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.880
Think about the situation we're in.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.350
Shut up!

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.100
P-Please stop the countdown.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:07.540
But...!

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:09.370
They have a hostage.

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:13.970
I cannot put the lives of over four hundred
people in jeopardy to save just one.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:15.710
Are you're giving up on her?

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:16.440
Stop it.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:18.280
I'm just stating what's theoretically just.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:19.480
We have to save her!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:21.620
Then you do it!

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:24.390
You know the password, do you?

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:25.350
Ikumi!

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:28.620
- Yes, sir!
- Go on!

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.590
Ikumi...

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:33.660
You see, I'm such a fool. I
never think of what comes next.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:34.820
Go!

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:50.910
Those two are taking forever.

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:52.310
They're probably playing around somewhere.

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:53.650
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:55.380
<i>I'm doing it! Can't you see?</i>

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:56.580
That voice!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.550
It's Ikumi!

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:58.790
<i>What are you doing?</i>

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:00.890
<i>N- Nothing, sir.</i>

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.820
It's been interrupted?

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:05.760
Don't you find the announcements weird?

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:07.730
Could it be...?

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.830
<i>Are you serious, lkumi? Think it over.</i>

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:25.580
- Hey you.
- Quiet!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:28.920
Hurry up.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.050
I'm sorry. The fact is, I...!

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:35.260
What is it?

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.060
I don't know the password.

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:39.250
What do you mean?

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:56.510
Take this!

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:00.780
You brat!

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:14.700
Stop! Don't kill him!

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:18.400
I said stop!

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:20.370
Don't give me orders!

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.530
I'm just telling you to do the obvious.

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.840
E-Excuse me...

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:34.250
W-We'd better do something
about getting this ship moving.

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:36.320
Confirm the status of the system at once!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:37.020
Right!

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:38.950
Has the program been affected?

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.090
Confirm if the program is operating!

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:45.990
It's unaffected! It's okay! Approach
countdown is still continuing!

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:47.530
What a relief!

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:50.860
You did well. Zwei thanks you!

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:58.770
Thank you for saving us.

00:17:58.770 --> 00:17:59.940
Ah, no problem.

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:02.080
You'd better be grateful.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:03.080
You know...!

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:04.050
Yes?

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:06.010
Can't you do something about
your easy-going nature?

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:08.750
Please don't make me change who I am.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:14.350
What's he so excited about?

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:18.090
Engine running at phase three!

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:23.550
Refreeze all repulsion levers!
Pressure increasing! Velocity, maximum!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:28.040
Attention, everybody on Liebel.
As you all remember from training...

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:31.140
...the G force during our flight will be
strongest from the direction we're headed.

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:34.380
<i>Please remain calm and limit all activities.</i>

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:35.980
<i>We will commence our escape</i> in...

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:36.910
<i>...seven...</i>

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:37.980
<i>...six...</i>

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:38.980
<i>...five...</i>

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:39.980
<i>...four...</i>

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:41.150
<i>...three...</i>

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:42.120
<i>...two...</i>

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:43.220
<i>...one.</i>

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:44.280
Go!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:51.890
It's not moving.

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:54.400
Hey! Why not?

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.690
I told you we wouldn't succeed!

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:00.860
What do you mean? I never
heard any such thing!

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:13.950
Temperature of outer wall increasing!
Liebe Delta is moving 0.23 in Phi direction!

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:15.280
We're descending?

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:16.720
We're being pulled by something!

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:18.690
Make them stop it!

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:34.270
Our outer wall is as good
as gone! We're finished!

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:40.270
Sere two, 970.

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.910
975.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.440
980.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:45.010
990.

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:46.480
995.

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:51.820
Is this it?

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:55.280
Entering Sere Three. We've
exceeded our depth limit.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:06.090
W-Wait. Not yet!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:32.130
Our target has begun to move.
Estimated power 720, 800

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.750
We're being pulled back!

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:40.630
Distortion of the ship is
approaching critical level.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:44.090
Outer wall tone and grahp
levels both increasing.

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:49.510
Alert! The condition has surpassed level
7. Purge of the attachment is advised!

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:50.580
Captain!

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:51.810
This can't be...

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:55.680
I don't want to die. I
want to see them again.

00:20:55.680 --> 00:21:00.250
Don't die. No way. I'm scared.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:04.390
We're all going to die. Please stop.

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:08.350
I can't stand this.
I don't want to die. No.

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:12.760
Disconnect the wires! We'll end
up getting swallowed up in this!

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:29.950
I don't want to die.

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:32.350
I want to live.

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:34.550
I don't want to die.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.860
I want to live.

00:21:36.860 --> 00:21:38.830
I don't want to die.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:41.260
I don't want to die.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.900
It's been activated. The Bratica.

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:51.910
However...

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:07.660
Stop it.

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:11.810
In your dry eyes...

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:16.950
...a silhouette appears

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:21.660
The blue colored future...

00:22:21.660 --> 00:22:27.750
...swayed and glittered

00:22:29.560 --> 00:22:37.810
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:37.810 --> 00:22:46.410
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:54.860
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:54.860 --> 00:22:58.760
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:58.760 --> 00:23:05.130
goodbye

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:11.020
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:12.530
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Ring of Ryvius

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:13.960
Next episode: Ring of Ryvius
Ryvius.

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:18.460
Next episode: Ring of Ryvius
That's the name of a battleship designed for
outer space, hidden within Liebe Delta.

00:23:18.460 --> 00:23:21.900
Next episode: Ring of Ryvius
Here, we must begin
living together to survive.

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:22.900
Next episode: Ring of Ryvius

00:23:22.900 --> 00:23:25.570
Next episode: Ring of Ryvius
Encounters dance within Ryvius and...

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:27.940
Next episode: Ring of Ryvius
re-encounters expand
the ring of Ryvius.

